# papers/bibliography.bib is a manual, per-host export from a personal
# reference manager (see CLAUDE.md) -- not shippable source, so it's
# gitignored rather than tracked. papers/pdfs/ is the [source_pdfs].dir
# default in config.toml; keep it around (via .gitkeep) even though it
# starts empty, but don't track raw PDFs dropped into it.
papers/bibliography.bib
papers/pdfs/*
!papers/pdfs/.gitkeep
